This repository is a byte-exact copy of the LegalBench-RAG data export. It has no single license.
Each part keeps the license of its source. Follow the terms of every source you use.

Source                     License (as found on the upstream project pages)
-------------------------  --------------------------------------------------------------
LegalBench-RAG (queries)   MIT (github.com/zeroentropy-ai/legalbenchrag)
PrivacyQA                  MIT
ContractNLI                CC BY 4.0
CUAD v1                    CC BY 4.0 (Zenodo record 4595826)
MAUD                       Not stated in the MAUD repository. Not verified.

The upstream LegalBench-RAG README asks users to accept the usage policies of ContractNLI,
CUAD, MAUD and PrivacyQA. Contract and policy texts were filed publicly or published by their
authors; their copyright stays with their owners.
